==Czech==

===Etymology===
* From {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*berzьnъ||March; April}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*berza||birch}} + {{m|sla-pro|*-ьnъ}}
* Probably derived from {{m|cs|bříza||birch}}, which starts to bud (and give sap) in March.<ref>{{R:Rejzek 2007}}</ref><ref name="machek">{{R:Machek 1968}}</ref> Or it might be derived from {{m|cs|březí||gravid}}, because livestock is usually gravid in March.<ref name="machek" />

